This capture the flag tournament, hosted under the banner of NQR and spearheaded by {{Flag/se}} romeo, managed to gather twelve teams split into two divisions of six teams each. Despite an active season with most of the group games played, the playoffs did not live up to expectations, as only one semifinal was played in division 2 and division 1 respectively. {{Flag/se}} Lege Artis played four out of their five group game matches, winning all four, two 2-0 and two 2-1. They were trailed by {{Flag/se}} Da Quaking Manjakks who went 3-1 in group games, {{Flag/us}} American Idiots who went 3-2 and {{Flag/se}} The Hellraisers who went 1-4. <br><br>
{{Flag/se}} [[Da Quaking Manjakks]] defeated {{Flag/us}} [[American Idiots]]  with a convincing 3-0 in the semi finals, and {{Flag/se}} [[Lege Artis]] defeated {{Flag/se}} [[Hellraisers]] 3-1 with an epic nail-biter win on e2m2. However, {{Flag/se}} [[Da Quaking Manjakks]] and {{Flag/se}} [[Lege Artis]] never played the final, thus leaving the tournament without an official winner.
